# PEC AUTOTUNE (first real test case): dc-only periodic-error model, distinct RA/Dec drift
# rates. Checks that PECLOG's fitted dc term converges to what we told it to expect. No
# harmonics -- deliberately the simplest possible case before building up to a real
# steady-state session. Slews async then WAIT_SETTLED (matches how Nina actually sequences a
# goto, rather than relying on a captured SlewAbsolute line's isasync value), plus an extra 15s
# settle after slewing clears -- post-toggle/post-slew settling can run 20-40s on real hardware
# per docs/control.md, and slewing==false alone doesn't capture backlash/oscillation settling.
# log_position (PIDLOG/KFLOG) left off -- not needed for PEC analysis, just floods the log;
# log_pec (PECLOG) is enough.
#
# dc magnitude: an earlier attempt at 60/24 arcmin/hr caused the fit to diverge wildly
# (fit_rate ran to hundreds, harmonics ballooned to 20-120 despite injecting none). Reviewing
# real captured sessions (utility/replay/logs/ isn't where these live -- see logs/logs/*.log)
# showed real dc PE never exceeds roughly -15 to +8 arcmin/hr even over hours of real
# sync/pulse-guiding, and real short (~250s) session starts at the *same* timescale as this
# test show clean, bounded harmonics (h1/h2 well under 0.2) -- unlike our 60/24 attempt. So
# 60/24 was pushing the fit into a magnitude regime it's never actually had to handle, not
# exercising a genuine bug. Using 5/2 arcmin/hr here, comfortably inside the real observed
# range.
#
# pec_n_harmonics forced to 0: this test's 5-minute session covers only ~14% of pec_T_sec
# (2040s), which is enough of a mismatch that it's still worth testing the model matching the
# signal we're actually injecting (pure dc, no harmonics). Must be set before the
# advanced_alignment toggle below, which is what actually triggers the PEC model reset that
# picks up this value (n_harmonics is fixed at PecAxis construction, not live-updatable
# mid-fit).
127.0.0.1 -> PUT /api/v1/telescope/0/action {'Action': 'Polaris:ConfigUpdate', 'Parameters': '{"pec_n_harmonics": 0}'}
127.0.0.1 -> PUT /api/v1/telescope/0/action {'Action': 'Polaris:ConfigUpdate', 'Parameters': '{"advanced_alignment": false}'}
127.0.0.1 -> PUT /api/v1/telescope/0/action {'Action': 'Polaris:ConfigUpdate', 'Parameters': '{"advanced_alignment": true}'}
127.0.0.1 -> PUT /api/v1/telescope/0/action {'Action': 'Polaris:ConfigUpdate', 'Parameters': '{"advanced_pec": true, "advanced_sync_guiding": true, "log_pec": true}'}
127.0.0.1 -> PUT /api/v1/telescope/0/tracking {'Tracking': 'false'}
127.0.0.1 -> PUT /api/v1/telescope/0/tracking {'Tracking': 'true'}
127.0.0.1 -> PUT /api/v1/telescope/0/action {'Action': 'Polaris:SlewAbsolute', 'Parameters': '{"az": 240, "alt": 45, "roll": 0, "isasync": true}'}
REPLAY WAIT_SETTLED {"timeout_s": 60}
REPLAY SLEEP {"seconds": 15}
REPLAY SYNCGUIDE_PE {"ra_model": [5, 0, 0], "dec_model": [2, 0, 0], "exposure_s": 15, "session_min": 5}
